@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers
@{ Layout = "_InformationLayout"; }
@section Scripts {
<script asp-append-version="true" src="/js/research-math.js" defer></script>
<script asp-append-version="true" src="/js/settings/backups.js" defer></script>
}
<div class="information-heading"><h1>Privacy &amp; backups</h1><p class="muted">Manage your privacy choice and the data saved in this browser.</p></div>
<div class="settings-grid">
    <section class="settings-card" aria-labelledby="analytics-heading"><div class="settings-label"><h2 id="analytics-heading">Optional analytics</h2><p>Choose whether Cloudflare usage and performance measurements can run. <a href="/privacy#analytics">How analytics works</a></p></div><div class="settings-body"><p id="analytics-choice" role="status">Analytics is off unless you allow it.</p><p>Only the configured production site loads analytics after permission. Your choice lasts 180 days. Do Not Track and Global Privacy Control keep it off. Rejecting keeps all features and saved records; withdrawing an active beacon reloads the page.</p><p>Market-data requests, <a href="/privacy#site-requests">network-based request limits</a> and limited server diagnostics operate independently of your analytics choice. <a href="/privacy#monitoring">Server monitoring details</a></p><button type="button" data-privacy-open>Change privacy choice</button></div></section>
    <section class="settings-card" aria-labelledby="backup-heading"><div class="settings-label"><h2 id="backup-heading">Back up your data</h2><p>Save your watchlist, recent stocks, practice holdings, screener preset and theme.</p></div><div class="settings-body"><p>Export downloads a JSON file locally; nothing is uploaded. It includes practice quantities, purchase prices and dates. The file is not encrypted by Stocklumo. Keep it private and download a fresh copy after important changes.</p><p>Backups exclude analytics consent, motion preferences, live prices, unsaved edits and session charts. There is no automatic backup, server copy or device sync.</p><button type="button" id="backup-export">Download backup</button></div></section>
    <section class="settings-card restore-card" aria-labelledby="restore-heading"><div class="settings-label"><h2 id="restore-heading">Restore a backup</h2><p>Choose a trusted Stocklumo backup to validate and preview locally. No file is uploaded.</p></div><div class="settings-body"><p>Restore replaces only the categories in the file; empty categories clear current records. It does not merge entries. Download your current backup first. Your analytics choice is unchanged.</p><label for="backup-file">Stocklumo backup (.json, up to 128 KB)</label><input type="file" id="backup-file" accept=".json,application/json" aria-describedby="backup-status" /><p id="backup-preview"></p><button id="backup-restore" type="button" hidden>Replace saved data with this backup</button><p id="backup-status" role="status" tabindex="-1"></p></div></section>
    <section class="settings-card" aria-labelledby="storage-heading"><div class="settings-label"><h2 id="storage-heading">Storage &amp; motion</h2><p>Your browser holds your saved data. <a href="/privacy#browser-data">Storage details</a></p></div><div class="settings-body"><p>Lists, holdings, theme and your screener preset persist until changed or cleared. Other devices, browsers and site addresses have separate records. Blocked storage or private browsing can prevent saving.</p><p>The footer motion control pauses decorative animation for this session. If storage is blocked, the choice lasts only for the current page. Reduced-motion preferences are respected; market updates continue. Unsaved edits and session charts are not backed up.</p><p>Clear all saved records through your browser's site-data controls. Export first if needed. Delete downloaded backups separately; Stocklumo cannot recover cleared records.</p></div></section>
</div>
